WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:12.520
We'll be moving places for the second half.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.770
We'd like you to interview them about the secrets to Raimon's strength.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.040
We're so lucky that we get to watch them at the scene!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.310
Yeah, I'm looking forward to it.

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.290
But I hope Sasuke behaves.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:25.830
I bet all he'll do is sleep anyway.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.500
Kariya-kun, what's that for?

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:32.790
I-It's not that I want to get Tominaga-san's autograph or anything like that!{tsun}

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.500
I think it's about to start!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.760
Coach Endou looks so nervous.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.360
Okay, in 5!

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:44.250
4...

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.150
3...

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:50.450
Hi, I'm the announcer Tominaga Jun.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:55.860
This week, we'll continue our special program commemorating Raimon's Holy Road championship.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.890
This is the second part of the secrets to Raimon's strength!

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.080
Our guest this week is the coach, Endou Mamoru-san,

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:08.980
and the manager from when Coach Endou was a player in Raimon's soccer club, Kino Aki-san.

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:13.140
I-I'm Raimon Jr. High soccer club's captain, Endou Mamoru.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:16.210
Endou-kun, you're the coach, not the captain...

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.210
Oh, right.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:20.340
I'm the coach, Endou Mamoru.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:23.610
You're an amusing person, Coach.

00:01:24.860 --> 00:01:29.860
Aki-san, you're still involved with Raimon's soccer club today, right?

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:35.210
You're the landlord of the apartment where Matsukaze Tenma-kun lives.

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:35.940
Yes.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.140
I look forward to hearing what you two have to say today.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:40.950
Thank you for having us.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:41.950
Thank you.

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:47.010
I wonder what Coach Endou's going to talk about.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:34.900
JunJun is so cute in person!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.200
Isn't she, isn't she?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.120
Isn't she?!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:38.630
S-Sure...

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.850
Kariya, it's starting.

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:46.800
Coach Endou, Raimon's soccer club is well known around the nation today,

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:51.260
but it seems it was just a small club that was almost disbanded ten years ago.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:52.830
Yes.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.760
Could you give us some details about that time?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:02.070
Details...

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:06.870
At first, Endou-kun was the only member.

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:07.500
Right?

00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:08.690
Yes!

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.960
You were alone?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:16.770
Yes. Aki was around as a manager, but I was the only member.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.940
That must've been tough.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.630
But I was by myself when I started soccer, too.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.580
It wasn't a big deal to me.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.540
<i>Sorry, but our school doesn't have a soccer club.</i>

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.210
<i>This is the clubroom, right?</i>

00:04:57.460 --> 00:04:58.960
<i>Yes, that's right.</i>

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.570
<i>This?</i>

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.060
<i>I'll open it now.</i>

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:04.550
<i>Okay!</i>

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.080
<i>It's being used as a storage room...</i>

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.660
<i>Do you still want to use it when it's like this?</i>

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.720
<i>I'll tidy it up.</i>

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:18.790
<i>Once they know there's a soccer club, people will come to join.</i>

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:23.920
<i>What's that?</i>

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:26.840
<i>Hey, isn't that...</i>

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:29.590
<i>I thought so!</i>

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:32.240
<i>The clubroom's doorplate!</i>

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.040
<i>All right!</i>

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:41.610
<i>Raimon's soccer club is now...</i>

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:42.450
<i>Ready for business!</i>

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.240
<i>Yes?</i>

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:48.910
<i>Hello...</i>

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:51.020
<i>We're interested in joining...</i>

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:52.750
<i>Really?!</i>

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.570
<i>Come in, come in!</i>

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:55.810
<i>You're super welcome here!</i>

00:05:56.380 --> 00:06:00.120
The first members to join were Someoka and Handa.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:03.470
Then the year after that, we had new students.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.890
Kurimatsu, Shourin, Kabeyama, and Shishido joined.

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>Please let us join!</i>

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.290
But we still had a long way to go as a soccer club.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:17.480
<i>Although this is a bit sudden, there will be a practice match in a week's time.</i>

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.030
<i>Oh... So it's a match.</i>

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.690
<i>We get to have a match?!</i>

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.940
<i>The opponent is Teikoku Academy.</i>

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.320
<i>T-Teikoku?!</i>

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:35.880
Getting a practice match against Teikoku Academy is what literally got our soccer club moving.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.920
We were told that the soccer club would be disbanded if we lost.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.360
Kazemaru.

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.270
Max.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.300
Kageno.

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.300
Megane.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:53.720
We managed to gather up to eleven members.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:58.900
And the one to leave the biggest impression was, of course, Gouenji.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.500
<i>Then, why did you kick that ball yesterday?</i>

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.540
<i>You're really annoying.</i>

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:29.950
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:31.040
<i>It's time we showed them...</i>

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:33.340
<i>...how Teikoku plays soccer.</i>

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.100
<i>They're coming.</i>

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:36.300
<i>Go!</i>

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.220
<i>So close!</i>

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:54.650
<i>Endou looked like he was going to block it...</i>

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.840
<i>...but the power of the ball was too tremendous and it flies into the net!</i>

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:01.580
<i>With this, Teikoku has scored 19 points!</i>

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.760
<i>And now, it's Raimon's turn to kickoff!</i>

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.940
<i>But no one is able to stand other than Megane!</i>

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.290
<i>No!</i>

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.430
<i>I don't want to play anymore!</i>

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.970
<i>Oh, no! Raimon's ace has taken off his uniform!</i>

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:20.110
<i>Megane has given up on the match!</i>

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:21.110
<i>Just this one time...</i>

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.330
<i>Can you... forgive your brother?</i>

00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:30.040
Gouenji came to us when we were at the end of our line.

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:35.990
<i>That guy is running because he believe in me...</i>

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.950
<i>He believes that I will block it!</i>

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.870
<i>And once I've blocked it, he believes that I will pass the ball to him!</i>

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:51.610
<i>Go, Gouenji!</i>

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:55.270
<i>And the ball is passed to Gouenji!</i>

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.730
<i>Fire Tornado!</i>

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.980
That match was the first step for Raimon's soccer club.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:17.220
After that, more members came to the club.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.810
Domon-kun transferred in from Teikoku Academy.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.570
And there was Ichinose-kun, who we all thought had gone back to America.{iya, kanzen ni shinda hazu datta kedo}

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:27.350
Both of them came to love Raimon's soccer as well.

00:09:33.310 --> 00:09:36.380
Everyone grew stronger as the days went by.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:42.810
Then they went up against Teikoku Academy once more at the Football Frontier preliminary district finals.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.250
<i>What's the matter, Kidou?</i>

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.350
<i>I want to fight this match fairly.</i>

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.710
<i>You haven't planned any tricks, have you?</i>

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.420
Teikoku's captain at the time was Kidou.

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:04.980
Kidou wouldn't cooperate with the unfair ways of Teikoku's commander, Kageyama,

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:09.870
so he went his separate way from Kageyama to fight us fair and square.

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:14.550
<i>Emperor Penguin...</i>

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.110
<i>No. 2!</i>

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.310
<i>What?</i>

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.320
<i>Go!</i>

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:41.360
<i>Are you really that upset?</i>

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:42.660
<i>I am!</i>

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.250
<i>I want to take down Zeus Junior High!</i>

00:10:46.190 --> 00:10:48.040
<i>There is one way.</i>

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:51.840
<i>You've only seen Endou from the front.</i>

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.370
<i>How about letting him look after your back?</i>

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.530
After we came to understand each other through that match,

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:04.500
Kidou decided to leave Teikoku Academy and transfer into Raimon.

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:25.280
<i>This is my Majin The Hand!</i>

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:41.530
Thus, Raimon's soccer club came out victorious as the champion after their long fight in the Football Frontier Nationals.

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:44.510
That's right.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:50.140
Coach Endou was the one who revived Raimon's soccer club.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:52.660
We love soccer!

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:53.900
We love soccer!

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:59.960
We love soccer!

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:08.030
Next, we'd like to talk to Coach Endou and Kino Aki-san about Raimon's soccer club.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:14.870
In its second year after being revived, Raimon's soccer club won the Football Frontier championship.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:19.600
Ever since, it's been a strong presence in the national scene.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:23.840
What's the secret to Raimon's strength?

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.140
Everyone.{whoever expected him to say 'onigiri' raise your hand o/}

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:29.020
By everyone, do you mean the members of the soccer club throughout its history?

00:12:29.020 --> 00:12:35.190
No, the ones who made Raimon's soccer club strong weren't just members of the club itself.

00:12:36.130 --> 00:12:41.150
It's also thanks to everyone who fight us either as friends or enemies.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:03.920
<i>We have come from the far planet Aliea to act as messengers to your people.</i>

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:11.410
<i>We have decided to display our power to you in accordance with your planet's system.</i>

00:13:12.030 --> 00:13:13.440
<i>That system...</i>

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.270
<i>Is soccer.</i>

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.710
<i>Majin The...</i>

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:36.970
We went to stand up against Aliea Academy when they attacked schools around the nation.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.460
<i>That's the Inazuma Caravan.</i>

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:46.110
<i>The chairman's room is connected to this basement as a strategical base.</i>

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:48.830
<i>Wow! So cool!</i>

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.660
<i>A base, eh?</i>

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.540
<i>Why is this...?</i>

00:13:54.540 --> 00:13:57.290
<i>As you can see, it's the new club room.</i>

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:00.190
<i>So you'll need that.</i>

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.660
Coach Hibiki was there to see us off.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:10.750
<i>I didn't think they were a bunch of spoiled kids who couldn't do anything without their coach.</i>

00:14:11.270 --> 00:14:15.380
Coach Hitomiko was brought in to create Earth's strongest team.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:19.010
<i>You better be prepared.</i>

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:24.300
<i>Inazuma Caravan...</i>

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.560
<i>Takeoff!</i>

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:35.770
<i>If you're going to say that much, why not prove it to us?</i>

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.540
Prime Minister Zaizen's daughter, Touko.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.060
<i>The Tower!</i>

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.550
Fubuki from Hakuren Jr. High.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.330
<i>Blow 'em over!</i>

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.710
<i>Eternal Blizzard!</i>

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:05.410
<i>Serves you right!</i>

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:08.720
<i>You'd better not get cocky just 'cause you won the Football Frontier!</i>

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.590
Kogure from Manyuuji Jr. High.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.890
<i>Senpuujin!</i>

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:25.580
Rika from Osaka.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.590
<i>Rose Splash!</i>

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.070
<i>Endou-san!</i>

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.540
Tachimukai from Yokato Jr. High.

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:40.600
<i>I am so honored!</i>

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.790
<i>I'm never going to wash these hands ever again!</i>

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:50.010
<i>Mugen The Hand!</i>

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.500
Tsunami from Oumihara Jr. High.

00:16:00.590 --> 00:16:02.950
<i>Yo, I've been looking for you, Endou.</i>

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:09.320
Aphrodi came to save us in a tight spot.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.970
Reize from Gemini Storm.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.030
Desarm from Epsilon.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.370
<i>Drill Smasher!</i>

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.920
And Gran from The Genesis.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.730
<i>Ryuusei Blade!</i>

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:32.880
<i>Let's play soccer.</i>

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:34.970
<i>Fuyuka.</i>

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.300
<i>Dad.</i>

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:42.600
Coach Kudou, who fought with us for the Football Frontier International.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.600
<i>Listen up.</i>

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:46.770
<i>The path moving up to the world is steep.</i>

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:51.240
Toramaru, who joined Inazuma Japan despite being only an elementary school student.

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.700
<i>Go!</i>

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.830
<i>Tiger Drive!</i>

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:03.240
<i>I grew up doing deliveries, you know!</i>

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.780
<i>I'm free to do what I want, aren't I?</i>

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:07.160
<i>What's with you?!</i>

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.500
Toby the Kicker, Tobitaka.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.930
Fudou, who was a player for True Teikoku Academy.

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.610
Hijikata, who came from Okinawa.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.360
Sakuma from Teikoku came, too.

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:36.920
Midorikawa and Hiroto from Aliea Academy came, too.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.590
<i>Tenkuu...</i>

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:46.530
<i>Otoshi!</i>

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:52.000
Edgar from Knights of Queen.

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:58.010
<i>Excalibur!</i>

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.640
<i>Iron Wall!</i>

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.730
Teres from The Empire.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.100
Mark and Dylan from Unicorn.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.620
<i>Unicorn Boost!</i>

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.070
Roniejo from The Kingdom.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:18.000
<i>Strike Samba V3!</i>

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:20.880
<i>Sorry about your ball!</i>

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.740
Fidio from Orpheus.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:28.670
<i>Odin Sword!</i>

00:18:34.620 --> 00:18:36.970
Rococo from Little Gigant.

00:18:38.490 --> 00:18:40.430
<i>Let's meet at the finals, Mamoru.</i>

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:45.010
And my grandpa, Endou Daisuke.

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:47.690
<i>So have I.</i>

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:49.100
<i>Grandpa...</i>

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:01.450
<i>Just what I'd want for the fight to be the world's best!</i>

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:04.660
<i>They even broke through my God Hand X...</i>

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.240
<i>Awesome!</i>

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:11.310
At the Football Frontier International finals,

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.940
I fought against my grandpa and his disciple, Rococo.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:26.470
<i>Let's go, guys!</i>

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:32.290
<i>Tamashii The Hand!</i>

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:40.470
<i>God Catch!</i>

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.670
<i>We won!</i>

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:03.650
Soccer can't be played alone.

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:08.930
It isn't soccer until your teammates and rivals join in.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:13.090
That goes for Raimon's soccer club as well.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:20.870
Yes, this is what everyone who's been involved with Raimon's soccer club has created.

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:27.410
I want to keep protecting this precious soccer club from now on.

00:20:22.730 --> 00:20:23.940
Tenma!

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.740
Hey, what're you doing?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.060
Coach Endou.

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:36.660
I want to protect Raimon's soccer club with you forever, too!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.570
Tenma.

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:39.690
Yeah!

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.910
Um, Tenma-kun?

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:44.250
Could we save that for later?

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:45.820
Tominaga-kun!

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:47.940
Leave them be!

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:50.950
This is a marvelous and touching scene!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.190
Right, Kariya-kun?

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:53.840
Don't you think so too?

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:55.160
Y-Yes!

